---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OldWasherPickupIsland from '../components/islands/OldWasherPickupIsland';

const serviceSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Old Washer Pickup",
  "description": "Free old washer removal in Ocean Springs, MS when you start a Sudsy Co. rental. We haul away your old machine at no extra charge.",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "@id": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/#localbusiness",
    "name": "Sudsy Co. Rentals",
    "telephone": "+1-228-338-3455",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "streetAddress": "1302 Fort St",
      "addressLocality": "Ocean Springs",
      "addressRegion": "MS",
      "postalCode": "39564",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Mississippi"
  },
  "url": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/old-washer-pickup/",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "price": "0",
    "priceCurrency": "USD",
    "priceSpecification": {
      "@type": "UnitPriceSpecification",
      "price": "0",
      "priceCurrency": "USD",
      "unitText": "month"
    }
  }
};

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Old Washer Pickup" }
  ]
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Old Washer Pickup Ocean Springs MS | Free Removal | Sudsy Co."
  description="Free old washer pickup in Ocean Springs, MS when you rent from Sudsy Co. We haul away your old machine at no extra charge. Call (228) 338-3455."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <h1 class="sr-only">Old Washer Pickup in Ocean Springs, MS</h1>
  <OldWasherPickupIsland client:only="react" />

  <!-- Rich SEO content — server rendered -->
  <section class="bg-muted/30 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: How Old Washer Pickup Works</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">It's straightforward:
</p>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li><strong>Schedule your rental delivery</strong> — call (228) 338-3455 or start online</li>
  <li><strong>Let us know you have an old machine</strong> — mention it when you book and we'll come prepared</li>
  <li><strong>We deliver your rental and remove the old washer</strong> — same visit, no second trip</li>
  <li><strong>Your laundry space is clean and ready</strong> — new rental installed, old machine gone</li>
</ol>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">If you have both an old washer and an old dryer to remove, ask about <a href="/old-dryer-pickup" class="text-primary hover:underline">old dryer pickup</a> at the same time.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: What Happens to Your Old Washer</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We handle proper disposal of removed appliances. If the machine has any usable life left, it may be refurbished and added to our rental or <a href="/used-washer-dryer-sales" class="text-primary hover:underline">used sales</a> inventory. If it's beyond repair, it gets disposed of responsibly. Either way, it's not your problem anymore.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Old Washer Pickup Without a Rental</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">If you just need an old washing machine removed and you're not starting a Sudsy Co. rental, contact us — we may be able to help depending on the machine's condition and our schedule. Call (228) 338-3455 to discuss.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Why Deal with Appliance Removal on the Gulf Coast?</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Getting rid of a broken washer on the Mississippi Gulf Coast isn't as simple as rolling it to the curb. Most municipalities have specific rules about appliance disposal. Junk removal services charge $75–$150 for a single appliance pickup. And the longer a dead machine sits in your home, the more it becomes a fixture you work around.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Sudsy Co. takes it out of your hands — literally.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Service Area</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We pick up old washers across Jackson County and Harrison County:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li>Ocean Springs</li>
  <li>Biloxi</li>
  <li>Gulfport</li>
  <li>D'Iberville</li>
  <li>Pascagoula</li>
  <li>Gautier</li>
  <li>Long Beach</li>
  <li>Pass Christian</li>
  <li>Moss Point</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Schedule Old Washer Pickup</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Call <strong>(228) 338-3455</strong> or <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:underline">start your rental online</a>. Mention your old machine when you book and we'll handle it the same day we deliver.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Sudsy Co. Washer and Dryer Rentals</strong> Locally owned. Ocean Springs, MS. Serving the Mississippi Gulf Coast.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
